{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/3","id":4851977171,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUZxf888AAAABITNL0w","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/3.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/3","number":3,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(windows): 透明应用图标与独立单色托盘","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Windows 应用和托盘此前复用带白色圆角底板的共享图标，主体只有75%。本次按用户确认的90%透明方案导出Windows专属ICO/PNG；16px保留一像素透明安全边距。macOS图标、默认PNG、ICNS和模板托盘保持原样。\n\nWindows托盘使用独立单色亮/暗素材，按系统任务栏主题选择并沿既有系统主题事件刷新；应用内主题不强制改变托盘前景。回归检查主体、安全边距、单色和镂空，拒绝把白色底板计入有效图形。\n\n验证：用户确认旧隔离实例的临时预览后已还原；本机7档ICO/14档托盘素材通过，旧7档ICO被新背景合同拒绝。bb3122d push CI38499759600、PR CI38499860360及候选38499860139均success；隔离runner的MSI/NSIS新装、首屏和卸载通过。两ZIP摘要/CRC、安装包及MSI只读提取EXE身份匹配，EXE七档内嵌图标像素与源码一致，两个单色托盘PNG均嵌入。\n\n旧实例结束确认0后，新EXE在同一隔离根启动，PID39680/普通false/type3，来源日志匹配bb3122d；标题栏去底板实际观察通过，原日常EXE及隔离偏好/根/策略/调度摘要保持。实际任务栏/托盘像素与物理主题切换矩阵仍待完整验收，不以旧预览或runner代替。\n\n本草稿基于更新说明分支，仅展示Windows图标改动。不自动合并或发布；原0.1.10全部门禁、性能failed与预算保持。证据：docs/governance-main 的 `.adg/evidence/OCX-0110-20261014-WIN-ICON-IMPLEMENTATION/`，平台素材：`docs/04-项目资料/04-品牌与图标素材/03-平台交付/Windows/assets-20261014.json`。\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:12:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T02:37:00Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"da59160f6a9775e1d0d638fd10c601bca1a4c794","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/bb3122d678a9c6fdbd2c8bd78fa9f3f22b955c8a","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-windows-transparent-icons","ref":"feature/0.1.10-windows-transparent-icons","sha":"bb3122d678a9c6fdbd2c8bd78fa9f3f22b955c8a","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin"